 become more realistic than before!", "short_description": "BIT INVASION UPDATE\uff01\nGRID BALL has been updated, coming with a brand new game mode and visual updates!\n\n\u3010BIT INVASION\u3011\nNew game mode! Repel a myriad of BITs that relentlessly attack the player. \nIt's a fast-paced game mode with high emphasis on action. Combine numerous PERKs and devise your own strategy to protect the GRID from the invading BITs!\nLeaderboards are also included, aim for the 1st place in the rankings!\n\n\u3010ONE BALL\u3011\nUpdated visuals!\nDestroy all BITs in a grid as efficiently as possib"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/termsofuse", "publisher_name": "SuperAppli Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.super-appli.co.jp/en/grid-ball", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "522914945856883"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035420_661140004824862_6226830565877973771_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0L3jH_JWIjIQ7kNvwG9lVpp&_nc_oc=Adq-6lQaEyykbYaalJMSMGn9hSQ-FgOFFRxDNK29Gdz5e9hfL8MfJTb24Lc7xBWUBOM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-